---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/paths";
---
<Layout title="For Parents | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">For parents</div><h1>They're far from home. We are not.</h1><p class="lead">A local, board-certified pediatrician in Blacksburg. Direct text. Same-day in town. A letter to the doctor who has known them since kindergarten.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Chronic care</h3><p>The list you already know stays on track. A local pediatrician holds the plan while they live here, and writes their hometown doctor when it shifts.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="num">2</div><h3>A trained eye nearby</h3><p>Someone looking after your kid, in the same town. Eight minutes from campus — a room they can get to between classes.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="num">3</div><h3>They learn care now</h3><p>These are the years they learn how to be a patient. We sit with them now, so they know how when you're not in the next room.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Student, physician, and you</h3><p>Your student has a say. You get the standing rule you agree on. Their hometown doctor gets the note the same afternoon.</p></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">Nearby, in practice</div><h2>A pediatrician who lives here.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><h3>They text the doctor</h3><p>A number they actually have. The physician in Blacksburg.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><h3>Same day</h3><p>A panel small enough that same-day is real. In town, not a chart in another state.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-compass"/></svg><h3>A letter home</h3><p>Named on day one. Copied when it counts. May note home; August starts from a full page.</p></div></div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a> &nbsp; <a class="lnk" href={href("membership")}>$119 a month while they're on campus &rarr;</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
